# handoff-completion-assertion drives three hooks and their shared predicate in place, copies the
# whole hooks directory for its mutant battery (cp "$HOOKS_DIR"/*.sh), and reads the pause-routing
# vocabulary. The settings template is deliberately NOT declared: the one arm that parses it
# stands down with an ok when it is absent (it is distribution-only), and a declared path under
# templates/ is exit 2 on a consumer, where it is not installed.
core/hooks/
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-continue.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-recover.sh
!core/hooks/ai-dlc-handoff-pending.sh
!core/schemas/pause-routing.json
core/fixtures/lib/
